    {"researchFeatureId":"RF_WEAK_CHERRY","featureId":"FEAT_WEAK_CHERRY","adoptionCategory":"INCLUDE_PRIMARY","minimumSample":500,"sampleRecommendation":5000,"weight":1,"numeratorInputId":"INP_WEAK_CHERRY","denominatorInputId":"INP_ALL_GAMES","difficultyParticipation":"INCLUDE","difficultyExposure":{"mode":"per_game","factor":1,"quality":"EXACT","basisId":"ALL_GAMES"},"userReason":"全ゲーム分母の設定別確率が明確で約1/50～1/60と高頻度、さらに実機連動機能で小役確率を取得できるため、誤分類の少ない主Featureとして採用します。"},
    {"researchFeatureId":"RF_WATERMELON_MAGIA_CHALLENGE","featureId":"FEAT_WATERMELON_MAGIA_CHALLENGE","adoptionCategory":"INCLUDE_SUPPORT","minimumSample":10,"sampleRecommendation":100,"weight":1,"numeratorInputId":"INP_MAGIA_CHALLENGE_FROM_WATERMELON","denominatorInputId":"INP_WATERMELON_ELIGIBLE","difficultyParticipation":"EXCLUDE","userReason":"さなモード以外のスイカ成立を専用分母にした条件付きCZ当選率で、対象状態と契機を判別できた試行だけなら小役頻度とは別の情報として評価できるため補助採用します。","difficultyExclusionReason":"通常ゲーム数から対象スイカ試行数を正確に導出できないため共通Difficultyでは除外します。"},
    {"researchFeatureId":"RF_WATERMELON_KUROE_CHALLENGE","featureId":"FEAT_WATERMELON_KUROE_CHALLENGE_EXCLUDED","adoptionCategory":"EXCLUDE","userFacingReason":"マギアチャレンジと同じ対象スイカ分母上の競合当選で、別々の二項尤度にすると同じスイカ試行を二重評価するうえ出現率0.4～0.8%と低いため不採用です。"},
    {"researchFeatureId":"RF_MAGICAL_GIRL_MODE_RESET_AT_END_DIST","featureId":"FEAT_MAGICAL_GIRL_MODE_RESET_AT_END_DIST_EXCLUDED","adoptionCategory":"EXCLUDE","userFacingReason":"有利区間移行/AT終了時に内部選択される魔法少女モードの完全カテゴリを毎回確実に観測できる公開契約がなく、潜在状態の誤分類を避けて不採用です。"},
    {"researchFeatureId":"RF_MAGICAL_GIRL_MODE_BONUS_END_DIST","featureId":"FEAT_MAGICAL_GIRL_MODE_BONUS_END_DIST_EXCLUDED","adoptionCategory":"EXCLUDE","userFacingReason":"AT非当選ボーナス終了時かついろはモードという内部条件を正確に判定して全移行先を観測する必要があり、公開multinomialの分母を安定再現できないため不採用です。"},
    {"researchFeatureId":"RF_HIGH_STATE_RESET_AT_END_DIST","featureId":"FEAT_HIGH_STATE_RESET_AT_END_DIST_EXCLUDED","adoptionCategory":"EXCLUDE","userFacingReason":"高確非移行/10G/20G/30Gという内部状態の選択結果を毎回完全に識別する必要があり、公開分布と同じ試行を実戦で確実に再現できないため不採用です。"},
