    {"researchFeatureId":"RF_EPISODE_BONUS_CHARACTER_DIST","featureId":"FEAT_EPISODE_BONUS_CHARACTER_DIST","adoptionCategory":"INCLUDE_SUPPORT","minimumSample":2,"sampleRecommendation":20,"weight":1,"numeratorInputId":"INP_EPISODE_YACHIYO","denominatorInputId":"INP_EPISODE_HINT_TOTAL","categoryInputIds":["INP_EPISODE_TSURUNO","INP_EPISODE_SANA","INP_EPISODE_FELICIA","INP_EPISODE_KUROE"],"difficultyParticipation":"EXCLUDE","userReason":"除外条件を満たした設定示唆系エピソードボーナスではキャラクターを直接観測でき、対象エピソード総数を専用分母とする完全分布なので補助Featureとして採用します。","difficultyExclusionReason":"通常ゲーム数から対象エピソード発生試行数を厳密に導出できないため共通Difficultyでは除外します。"},
    {"researchFeatureId":"RF_MITAMA_REWARD_L2_AT","featureId":"FEAT_MITAMA_REWARD_L2_AT_EXCLUDED","adoptionCategory":"EXCLUDE","userFacingReason":"公開確率の分母は内部報酬レベル2のウワサバトル発展ですが、画面表示から内部レベル2を確実に識別できる契約が未解決のため不採用です。"},
